DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aauuttrrii device driver supports the AC'97 audio controller found in Tri‐
     dent 4DWAVE-DX/NX, SiS 7018 and ALi M5451.  aauuttrrii typically has reversed
     stereo channels.  The driver compensates for this, but the compensation
     can be turned off by setting flags to 0x0001.

